###===================ENTWICKLER-PROGRAMMIERUNGSBEREICH=====================###

 BEREICH TASTENCODES : 

 WEG: EFI_USB_IO_PROTOCOL
   1. LocateHandleBuffer(ByProtocol, UsbIo-GUID) → alle USB-Handles
   2. UsbGetDeviceDescriptor / UsbGetInterfaceDescriptor
      → bInterfaceClass=0x03 (HID), bInterfaceSubClass=0x01 (Boot),
        bInterfaceProtocol=0x01 (Keyboard)
   3. UsbControlTransfer: SET_PROTOCOL(0) → Boot Protocol erzwingen
      (bmRequestType=0x21, bRequest=0x0B, wValue=0, wIndex=Interface)
   4. Interrupt-IN-Endpoint pollen: UsbBulkTransfer/UsbInterruptTransfer
      → 8-Byte Boot Report

 BOOT REPORT LAYOUT:
   Byte 0    Modifier-Bitmap
   Byte 1    reserved
   Byte 2-7  bis zu 6 gleichzeitige HID-Usage-Codes (Rollup)

 MODIFIER-BITS (Byte 0):
   bit0 LCtrl   bit1 LShift   bit2 LAlt   bit3 LGUI
   bit4 RCtrl   bit5 RShift   bit6 RAlt = AltGr   bit7 RGUI

 HID USAGE PAGE 0x07 (Auszug, DE-Belegung):
   0x04 a/A   0x05 b/B   ... 0x1D z/Z
   0x1E 1/!   0x1F 2/"   0x20 3/§   0x21 4/$   0x22 5/%
   0x23 6/&   0x24 7/{   0x25 8/(   0x26 9/)   0x27 0/=
   0x2D ß/?   0x2E ´/`   0x2F ü/Ü   0x30 +/*   0x31 #/'
   0x32 </>   0x33 ö/Ö   0x34 ä/Ä   0x35 ^/°
   0x36 ,/;   0x37 ./:   0x38 -/_   0x28 Enter  0x29 Esc
   0x2A Backspace  0x2B Tab  0x2C Space

 DEINE TABELLE — (Modifier, Usage) → MCS-Symbol:
   SHIFT+0x1F        → "     PRINT
   SHIFT+0x31        → '     SHELL
   SHIFT+0x20        → §     NETZWERK
   SHIFT+0x21        → $     PFAD
   SHIFT+0x37        → :     (alle Boxis, End-Delimiter)
   0x36              → ,     SYSCALL
   ALTGR+0x30        → ~     MCD
   ALTGR+SHIFT+0x0B  → Ħ     ABI      (h = 0x0B)
   ALTGR+SHIFT+0x1D  → ¥     EINGABE  (z = 0x1D)
   ALTGR+SHIFT+0x10  → °     OPCODE   (m = 0x10)
   ALTGR+SHIFT+0x17  → Ŧ     UTF      (t = 0x17)
   ALTGR+SHIFT+0x2D  → ¿     TWS      (ß = 0x2D)
   ALTGR+SHIFT+0x1E  → ¡     STROM    (1 = 0x1E)
   → °° / ¶¶ / ΩΩ / ·· durch Wiederholung, LONGEST-MATCH im Lexer

